id=netstats-fix
name=Network Stats Fix (Universal GSI)
version=v4.0
versionCode=7
author=Flint
description=Fixes broken network traffic indicator and per-UID network stats on Android 12-16 GSIs. Correctly sets ro.bpf.kver_override to the actual kernel version, forces BPF reload by clearing mainline_done, falls back to xt_qtaguid/uid_stat on legacy kernels, and ensures interface-level stats as a minimum. Universal compatibility across EvoX, Infinity X, Axion, and other Treble GSIs.
